c-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">When should a child be seen?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">An orthodontic assessment can help identify developing concerns involving tooth eruption, bite or jaw growth. The appropriate timing depends on the individual child, and an assessment does not necessarily mean treatment must begin immediately.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">Do I need a referral?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">No referral is required. You are welcome to contact the clinic directly to arrange a consultation.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">Can adults get braces?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">Yes. Adults may be suitable for orthodontic treatment provided the teeth and supporting tissues are healthy. Treatment options depend on the clinical findings and the goals of the patient.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">What happens at the first visit?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">We discuss your concerns and dental history, carry out an initial clinical assessment and explain the likely options. Records may be taken if further planning is needed.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">Which services do you offer?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">We focus on five core areas: orthodontics, restorative and endodontics, prosthodontics, periodontics, and oral and maxillofacial surgery. Cases that need more than one of these are planned jointly.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:clamp(34px,4.4vw,56px)\">\r\n<div class=\"bb-head bb-head-tight\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0px auto clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 58px);margin-bottom:clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px)\">\r\n<p class=\"bb-eyebrow\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);margin-bottom:18px;text-align:center\">Treatment<\/p>\r\n<h2 class=\"bb-h2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:balance;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(29px, 3.9vw, 50px);line-height:1.13;color:rgb(62, 69, 48);text-align:center\">Options &amp; Timelines<\/h2>\r\n<span class=\"bb-bar\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:rgb(194, 164, 105);margin:20px auto;text-align:center\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc\" data-acc=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-top:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);text-align:left;max-width:100%\">\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">How long does treatment take?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">Treatment duration varies according to the complexity of the case, the type of appliance, growth and patient cooperation. A personalized estimate is provided after assessment and planning.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:non