n for a day or two after an appliance is fitted or adjusted. It usually settles quickly, and we advise on how to stay comfortable.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px);line-height:1.35;color:rgb(74, 84, 56);min-height:56px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">Will I need teeth removed?<i style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-style:normal;color:rgb(178, 147, 79);transition:transform 0.3s;text-align:left\">+<\/i><\/button><div class=\"bb-acc-p\" data-acc-p=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;max-height:0px;transition:max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);text-align:left\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;text-wrap:pretty;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(92, 94, 84);padding:0px 16px 22px;max-width:70ch;text-align:left\">Not always. Whether extractions are required depends on space, crowding and the treatment plan. This is discussed clearly before treatment starts.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n<div class=\"bb-acc-i\" data-acc-i=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(230, 227, 216);border-radius:12px;transition:background 0.3s;text-align:left\"><button class=\"bb-acc-b\" type=\"button\" data-acc-b=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 16px;font-size:c